{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T7riebTXromEWRNRSrHCFu","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"title\":\"Decision\",\"permalink\":\"ms/schemas/decision\",\"file_path\":\"schemas/Decision.md\",\"content\":\"\\n# Decision\\n\\nA **DecisionNote** is a durable record of a real choice — one with alternatives\\nand a rationale, not a passing preference. Basic Memory host integrations\\nencourage agents to capture these as decisions are made or explicitly requested.\\n\\nDecisions are found by structured recall:\\n`bm_search(filters={\\\"type\\\": \\\"decision\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"open\\\"})`.\\n\\n## What makes a good DecisionNote\\n\\n- **decision** — state the choice plainly.\\n- **rationale** + **alternative** — why this, and what was rejected. This is the\\n  part that saves a future session from relitigating the same ground.\\n- **consequence** — what the choice commits the work to.\\n- **affects** / **supersedes** — relations that wire the decision into the graph.\\n\\n## Frontmatter\\n\\n`type: decision` plus `status` make decisions queryable. Capture decisions\\nsparingly — one note per genuine decision, not per opinion. Validation is `warn`,\\nnever blocking.\",\"frontmatter\":null,\"checksum\":\"b39f2896104eec2c9f72f0b5bd63e58feb5584678ddcfc18c84c61c7eeb21ca2\",\"section\":null,\"start_line\":26,\"end_line\":48,\"total_lines\":48,\"has_more\":false,\"next_start_line\":null,\"next_end_line\":null}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1baf4b0-0bb7-4a49-9820-1c5055232c92","uuid":"0c282693-3f37-4d6c-bc55-7c05772235a5","timestamp":"2026-11-02T19:51:11.570Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"title\":\"Decision\",\"permalink\":\"ms/schemas/decision\",\"file_path\":\"schemas/Decision.md\",\"content\":\"\\n# Decision\\n\\nA **DecisionNote** is a durable record of a real choice — one with alternatives\\nand a rationale, not a passing preference. Basic Memory host integrations\\nencourage agents to capture these as decisions are made or explicitly requested.\\n\\nDecisions are found by structured recall:\\n`bm_search(filters={\\\"type\\\": \\\"decision\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"open\\\"})`.\\n\\n## What makes a good DecisionNote\\n\\n- **decision** — state the choice plainly.\\n- **rationale** + **alternative** — why this, and what was rejected. This is the\\n  part that saves a future session from relitigating the same ground.\\n- **consequence** — what the choice commits the work to.\\n- **affects** / **supersedes** — relations that wire the decision into the graph.\\n\\n## Frontmatter\\n\\n`type: decision` plus `status` make decisions queryable. Capture decisions\\nsparingly — one note per genuine decision, not per opinion. Validation is `warn`,\\nnever blocking.\",\"frontmatter\":null,\"checksum\":\"b39f2896104eec2c9f72f0b5bd63e58feb5584678ddcfc18c84c61c7eeb21ca2\",\"section\":null,\"start_line\":26,\"end_line\":48,\"total_lines\":48,\"has_more\":false,\"next_start_line\":null,\"next_end_line\":null}","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Basic Memory","version":"4.1.3"}},"structuredContent":{"title":"Decision","permalink":"ms/schemas/decision","file_path":"schemas/Decision.md","content":"\n# Decision\n\nA **DecisionNote** is a durable record of a real choice — one with alternatives\nand a rationale, not a passing preference. Basic Memory host integrations\nencourage agents to capture these as decisions are made or explicitly requested.\n\nDecisions are found by structured recall:\n`bm_search(filters={\"type\": \"decision\", \"status\": \"open\"})`.\n\n## What makes a good DecisionNote\n\n- **decision** — state the choice plainly.\n- **rationale** + **alternative** — why this, and what was rejected. This is the\n  part that saves a future session from relitigating the same ground.\n- **consequence** — what the choice commits the work to.\n- **affects** / **supersedes** — relations that wire the decision into the graph.\n\n## Frontmatter\n\n`type: decision` plus `status` make decisions queryable. Capture decisions\nsparingly — one note per genuine decision, not per opinion. Validation is `warn`,\nnever blocking.","frontmatter":null,"checksum":"b39f2896104eec2c9f72f0b5bd63e58feb5584678ddcfc18c84c61c7eeb21ca2","section":null,"start_line":26,"end_line":48,"total_lines":48,"has_more":false,"next_start_line":null,"next_end_line":null}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01T7riebTXromEWRNRSrHCFu","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgegbfVVRfHxXSFmvRnFD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QubHyZAWzxoQ7UP4FnFhJt","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p .claude && cat > .claude/settings.local.json <<'EOF'\n{\"basicMemory\":{\"primaryProject\":\"ms\",\"secondaryProjects\":[],\"captureFolder\":\"sessions\",\"rememberFolder\":\"bm-remember\",\"recallTimeframe\":\"3d\",\"preCompactCapture\":\"extractive\",\"sessionProfile\":\"coding\",\"repository\":\"ms\",\"captureEvents\":true,\"placementConventions\":\"Starting-point suggestion, structure may stay emergent:\\n- decisions/ for engineering decisions (type decision)\\n- sessions/ for coding checkpoints\\n- tasks/ for active work\\n- notes/ for design notes and reference\\n- schemas/ holds note-type schemas\",\"teamProjects\":{}},\"outputStyle\":\"basic-memory\"}\nEOF\ngit check-ignore .claude/settings.local.json; git status --short\nP=ms; bm tool search --note-types decision --filters '{\"status\": \"open\"}' --page-size 5 --project $P 2>&1 | tail -5\nbm tool search --note-types schema --page-size 10 --project $P 2>&1 | tail -15\nbasic-memory hook status --harness claude --project-dir \"$PWD\" 2>&1 | tail -20","description":"Write settings and run smoke tests"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4061,"cache_read_input_tokens":35431,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4061},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1baf4b0-0bb7-4a49-9820-1c5055232c92","uuid":"ab71c5e7-223d-4256-8f53-8efbe4cdea9e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T19:51:13.914Z","request_id":"req_011CgegbfCt4oNLBXN3BN2fn"}
