{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A8p3t4y65RHTN3PUr8nGJQ","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: Decision\ntype: schema\npermalink: ms/schemas/decision\nentity: Decision\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  decision: string, the choice that was made\n  rationale?: string, why this choice over the alternatives\n  alternative?(array): string, options that were considered and not taken\n  consequence?(array): string, what this decision commits us to\n  context?: string, the situation that prompted the decision\n  affects?(array): Entity, work or notes this decision bears on\n  supersedes?: Entity, a prior decision this one replaces\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    status?(enum, lifecycle of the decision):\n    - open\n    - accepted\n    - superseded\n    - rejected\n    decided?: string, when the decision was made (ISO timestamp)\n    project?: string, the Basic Memory project this decision belongs to\n---\n\n# Decision\n\nA **DecisionNote** is a durable record of a real choice — one with alternatives\nand a rationale, not a passing preference. Basic Memory host integrations","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1baf4b0-0bb7-4a49-9820-1c5055232c92","uuid":"f1126ea6-a7b3-4209-8eeb-6bdd0957d44e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T19:51:27.609Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: Decision\ntype: schema\npermalink: ms/schemas/decision\nentity: Decision\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  decision: string, the choice that was made\n  rationale?: string, why this choice over the alternatives\n  alternative?(array): string, options that were considered and not taken\n  consequence?(array): string, what this decision commits us to\n  context?: string, the situation that prompted the decision\n  affects?(array): Entity, work or notes this decision bears on\n  supersedes?: Entity, a prior decision this one replaces\nsettings:\n  validation: warn\n  frontmatter:\n    status?(enum, lifecycle of the decision):\n    - open\n    - accepted\n    - superseded\n    - rejected\n    decided?: string, when the decision was made (ISO timestamp)\n    project?: string, the Basic Memory project this decision belongs to\n---\n\n# Decision\n\nA **DecisionNote** is a durable record of a real choice — one with alternatives\nand a rationale, not a passing preference. Basic Memory host integrations","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01A8p3t4y65RHTN3PUr8nGJQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgegd6XASVUpWieUfHR2V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this repo. The seeded schemas have nested frontmatter, and the smoke tests ran without errors.\n\n- **Project:** I created a new project, `ms`, at `~/basic-memory-projects/ms`. The default `~/basic-memory/ms` path sat inside your existing `main` project, and Basic Memory won't nest projects.\n- **Profile:** The profile is `coding` and the repository identifier is `ms`, from the directory name since there's no git remote.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task, with nothing already present to skip. I checked the Decision note on disk and `schema` and `settings` are nested objects, not strings. The `bm_read` JSON call returned `frontmatter: null`, so the on-disk check is my evidence.\n- **Placement:** The project was empty, so I suggested a light starting layout stored as `placementConventions`: `decisions/`, `sessions/`, `tasks/` and `notes/`. No folders were created.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills globally through `npx skills add`.\n- **Settings:** The config is in `.claude/settings.local.json` (personal, not committed). It has lifecycle-event capture on and `outputStyle: \"basic-memory\"`. That file shows as untracked in git status.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query returned 0 results, which is expected.\n  - The schema query returned all three schemas.\n  - `hook status` found the settings and reports project `ms`, profile `coding` and capture on.\n  - The shared inbox has 3 pending envelopes, 0 archived, and it has never been flushed.\n- **PreCompact checkpoint:** `hook status` shows \"checkpoint on compact: off\". I didn't change that, so it may not be on. Check the `preCompactCapture` value in the settings if you expected it.\n\nRestart the session to turn on the proactive-capture behaviour from the output style. Recall already works in this session.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":41032,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492},"output_tokens":702,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1baf4b0-0bb7-4a49-9820-1c5055232c92","uuid":"f718ff9c-b0bb-4eda-9291-80c13f227f9d","timestamp":"2026-11-02T19:51:33.727Z","request_id":"req_011Cgegd6KkWWesFrMnMNFEy"}
